---
title: "releaseVestedTokens (Legion Sale Contracts)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_get_vesting: retrieve position.vestingAddress for investor
    q_get_vesting --> q_check_exists: vestingAddress != address(0)
    q_get_vesting --> q_revert: revert NoVestingContract
    q_check_exists --> q_call_release: call vesting contract release()
    q_call_release --> q_transfer: vesting contract calculates releasable amount
    q_transfer --> [*]: transfer vested tokens to investor, emit VestedTokensReleased
    q_revert --> [*]: revert with error

    note right of q_call_release
        INV-001: release amount determined by vesting schedule and elapsed time
        INV-002: vesting contract deployed via EIP-1167 clone during claim
        INV-003: only tokens that have vested per schedule can be released
    end note
